<title>USA: W.W. Grainger to supply Lockheed Martin.</title>
<headline>W.W. Grainger to supply Lockheed Martin.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.W. Grainger Inc said Thursday it won a five-year, multi-million integrated supply contract to supply the aeronautics sector of Lockheed Martin Corp.</p>
<p>The agreement consolidates the purchasing of maintenance, repair and operating supplies at several of the sector's largest plants, including sites in Marietta, Ga. and Fort Worth, Texas.</p>
<p>Overall, the agreement could consolidate purchasing among several Lockheed Martin sector operations.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
